One Pair of Hands: third-party material in the film and its source
====================================================================

Client material
- Petros AI-Tech Agency logo lockup (brand/petros_lockup_dark.svg; the other brand files in brand/ were used only for
  reference), the brand colours (Deep Indigo #0B0F2A, Soft White #FAF6FF, Royal Purple #6A00FF, Neon Blue #00E5FF) and
  the tagline "Innovate Smarter. Create Beyond Limits.": supplied by the client from their brand folder, used as supplied.

Voice
- Narration: synthetic voice, Kokoro-82M v1.0 text-to-speech by hexgrad, voice "af_heart", Apache License 2.0
  (https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M); ONNX export by Taylor Chu, run with kokoro-onnx (MIT).
- Speech check (not in the film): faster-whisper with the Whisper base.en model (MIT).

Music: an original score written for this film (score.py)
- Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios /
  Sam Gossner), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios).
- Music box: physically modelled in code (no samples).

Sound effects and ambience
- All synthesized in code for this film (mix.py): paper, card, tab, page, stamp, printer, wheel, clock, crickets, purr.

Pictures
- Every drawing, character, set, mechanism and the real mug: drawn or modelled in code for this film.
- Environment light "Lythwood Lounge" HDRI, Poly Haven, CC0 (https://polyhaven.com/a/lythwood_lounge).
- "American Walnut Veneer" textures, Poly Haven, CC0 (https://polyhaven.com/a/american_walnut_veneer).

